        <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ROLLBACK: Use recovery_path to resume from a verified prior state.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ABORT: No recovery is possible; training must stop.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SKIP_SAVE: Fault was during save and is non-fatal; training continues without this checkpoint being persisted. </para>
